    <item>
      <title>Version 1.1.0 (5)</title>
      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Fri, 03 Apr 2026 23:26:38 +0100</pubDate>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- 10 new scanners: Cloud Storage, Office Apps, Electron Apps, CI/CD & Cloud, Developer Tools, Virtualization, Shell Tools, External Volumes, macOS Installers, and more programming languages
- Expanded browser coverage with 8 additional browsers including Brave, Edge, and Vivaldi
- Detects old Chromium framework versions inside browser apps (can save 200-800 MB)
- ML/AI model cache detection for HuggingFace, PyTorch, and TensorFlow
- Frontend build tool caches: Vite, Webpack, Parcel, ESLint, Prettier, and more
- JetBrains Toolbox old IDE version detection
- Incomplete download detection (.crdownload, .part files)
- External volume trash scanning
- Sandboxed app and Group Container cache scanning
- Smarter orphan detection with running-process awareness
- New custom icons for Docker, Android, Terraform, Git, and Electron
- Total coverage: 39 scanners, 148 sub-features]]></description>
